{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1090040-dreamcraft","id":1090040,"title":"Dreamcraft?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-08T17:14:58-07:00","id":1090040,"title":"Dreamcraft?","content":"I was quite saddened this seems to be one of the few Arts to make the cut. I am hoping it re-appears in the Freeholds book, but the loss of such a useful Art from the main book saddens me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13407-dybbuk67","name":"dybbuk67","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-08T17:41:46-07:00","id":1090054,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>dybbuk67</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1090040-dreamcraft#post1090040\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was quite saddened this seems to be one of the few Arts to make the cut. I am hoping it re-appears in the Freeholds book, but the loss of such a useful Art from the main book saddens me.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Sorry that an Art you liked didn't make the cut. Our criteria for Arts in C20 included: applicable to all (or most) Realms, mechanical impact within the game, multiple functionalities, worth spending points on and then using resources (like Glamour) in play, avoid multiple iterations of the same power within an Art, two Arts with similar powers needed to be distinct.<br /> <br /> Dreamcraft violated a few of these. The Art in general is not usable with most of the Realms. The first dot can be achieved with other Arts and the Fae realm. The second dot indicates that Fae 5 is typically the Realm used, which is an issue. Third dot is only useable in the Mythic Realm. Fourth dot was handled in Oneiromancy. Fifth dot costs permanent Glamour and is only useable in the Mythic realm. Overall, crafting Glamour in the Mythic Realm didn't seem like an area where players should need to spend their points (at least in Arts), and most of the individual powers didn't function well with most of the Realms.<br /> <br /> Good news is that the mechanics and game systems did not chance significantly enough to prevent Dreamcraft from simply being added to your C20 game. If you and your players loved that Art, ignore an old Grump like me and keep the dream(craft) alive!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13387-jonsan","name":"jonsan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-08T18:43:47-07:00","id":1090084,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>jonsan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1090040-dreamcraft?p=1090054#post1090054\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Sorry that an Art you liked didn't make the cut. Our criteria for Arts in C20 included: applicable to all (or most) Realms, mechanical impact within the game, multiple functionalities, worth spending points on and then using resources (like Glamour) in play, avoid <u>multiple iterations of the same power within an Art</u>, two Arts with similar powers needed to be distinct.</div> </div> </div> </div>take it this is why Soothsay got such a thorough overhaul...<br /> <br /> its going to be a lot more difficult for a Sidhe to &quot;reward the loyal service&quot; of an enchanted servant he's relasing from the freehold.even fatefire just adds dice, doesnt Gift a destiny to someone...<br /> <br /> It makes things a little harder... but I understand your reasons.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-09T05:29:42-07:00","id":1090249,"title":"","content":"Dreamcraft was very specific, though. Those abilities not folded into Oneiromancy are perhaps suited to their own universal subsystem like the one for Treasure creation. Indeed, I'd take the Treasure system as a guide: <br /> <br /> -To build an anchor in the Dreaming, you'd need a mystical item or items of equivalent rating to the anchor you want to build (an equivalent four-dot Treasure or four one-dot Treasures to build a mansion-sized barrier, for instance). You must also invest one point of Glamour per level.<br /> -To build a freehold or permanent chimerical structure, you need the requirements above, but the investment must be made with permanent Glamour instead. So a four-dot freehold would require the investment of four dots of Glamour (which can be invested by multiple changelings). You may rule that you can 'steal' one or more permanent dots from an existing freehold by taking some of its balefire to start the new balefire in your new freehold. In this way, you can 'share the love', as it were, but at the expense of spreading Glamour more thinly.<br /> <br /> What do you think?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-09T07:41:32-07:00","id":1090300,"title":"","content":"It might sail.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><